Z||000001||1FST2M6||01-08-2001||04:51 PM||||yeah.. how fast do you want to spend... uuum i mean go...   but yeah.. there really isn't any need for twin though unless they are tiny turbos... the stock one on a GN, GNX or Turbo T-type with an Profect running th ewaste gates will EASILY laydown over 300RWHP and with a larger turbo from Gowling green or turbonetics you can up the boost and not have the pain in the @$$ piping to deal with.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.engineered.net" TARGET=_blank>www.engineered.net</A>   - turbo cars i've delt with<BR> <A HREF="http://www.turboneticsinc.com" TARGET=_blank>www.turboneticsinc.com</A>  turbo info||||reg||1
